 <metadata>
  <name>Il Lombardia 2026 | The Route</name>
  <desc>EN The race starts in Bergamo and heads towards Val Seriana, with a short flat section before a succession of climbs through the Prealps surrounding the city. With 600 m to go, the riders negotiate one final sweeping left-hand bend. The finishing straight is on asphalt and is 7 m wide.
IT Partenza da Bergamo in direzione val Seriana per un breve tratto pianeggiante prima di affrontare una serie di salite nelle Prealpi attorno alla città. Ai 600 m dall’arrivo ultima ampia curva verso sinistra. Retta di arrivo su asfalto, larghezza della carreggiata 7 m.</desc>
  <author>
   <name>Giro  d'Italia</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/13281306"/>
  </author>
  <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors">
   <year>2020</year>
   <license>https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright</license>
  </copyright>
  <link href="https://www.strava.com/routes/3538143497274622494"/>
 </metadata>
